<!doctype lake><title>无标题文档</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="adapt" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><meta name="defaultFontsize" content="16" /><h2 data-lake-id="DJmNp" id="DJmNp" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u08ecd72f" id="u08ecd72f">📡</span><span data-lake-id="ua5ebd100" id="ua5ebd100" style="color: #DF2A3F"> </span><span data-lake-id="u43d777b0" id="u43d777b0">𝐎𝐩𝐭𝐢𝐦𝐢𝐳𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧</span></h2><p data-lake-id="uffb1094c" id="uffb1094c"><strong><span data-lake-id="u9a573eb5" id="u9a573eb5" style="color: #DF2A3F">Muon 的正交化配置。模型以 Muon 为主要优化器，通过 Newton–Schulz（NS）迭代对 Nesterov 动量进行正交化。动量系数设为 0.95，采用 Polar Express 的逐步迭代系数，并执行 8 次迭代。对于形状为</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22A%5C%5Ctimes%20B%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbb622e0f59cb8240aa8022f524cd4b33.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BbXl0%22%7D" style="color: #DF2A3F"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="udd0e6b05" id="udd0e6b05" style="color: #DF2A3F">的矩阵，正交化结果按</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cgamma(A%2CB)%3D0.2%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cmax(A%2CB)%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff718bd3a472a9e97c47c50de671fe4cf.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kDenL%22%7D" style="color: #DF2A3F"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u9d65bd34" id="u9d65bd34" style="color: #DF2A3F">缩放。更充分的正交化能够降低梯度范数尖峰的频率与幅度</span></strong></p><ul list="ucfc0f814"><li fid="u7f25f652" data-lake-id="ud9662463" id="ud9662463"><strong><span data-lake-id="u7ccf742e" id="u7ccf742e">按参数功能选择优化器。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u67284d08" id="u67284d08">Muon 主要用于承担线性映射的二维权重，包括注意力和 GDN 的主要投影、MoE 专家的线性层，以及 N-gram 嵌入层的键值投影。输入嵌入、输出头、MoE 路由器及 GR 的两个低秩投影保留 AdamW；N-gram 嵌入表则使用关闭权重衰减的 Adam。路由器使用 Muon 会加剧训练早期波动，在中后期切换也未获得显著性能收益</span></li><li fid="u7f25f652" data-lake-id="ucf24eeeb" id="ucf24eeeb"><strong><span data-lake-id="ue36ea19f" id="ue36ea19f">融合参数必须按独立算子拆分。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uf7744d67" id="uf7744d67">直接对融合矩阵进行正交化，会混合无关子块的奇异方向，并依据拼接后的形状计算更新缩放。因此，注意力 QKV 和 GDN 输入投影按头拆分，SwiGLU 的 fc1 按 gate 与 up 两部分拆分，分别执行正交化后再恢复原始布局。GDN 的衰减与 beta 投影在逐头拆分后为向量，不参与正交化。该处理使优化器更新与实际算子结构相匹配，并改善损失或下游表现</span></li><li fid="u7f25f652" data-lake-id="ue393e022" id="ue393e022"><strong><span data-lake-id="u768b5b76" id="u768b5b76">分布式实现围绕正交化成本调整。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ua1e25068" id="ua1e25068">Canzona 根据估计的 NS 浮点运算量，在数据并行进程之间分配完整矩阵，并通过跨张量并行进程的通信重建矩阵，保留与单设备 Muon 数学等价的更新及原有通信重叠。对于参数拆分产生的大量小计算核，则使用 CUDA Graph 捕获整个优化器步骤，降低启动开销</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u7944e1a5" id="u7944e1a5"><strong><span data-lake-id="u46cce43a" id="u46cce43a" style="color: #DF2A3F">新架构与优化器使近最优配置向更大的批量大小和学习率移动。 因此，重新拟合超参数缩放规律，而非直接沿用 Qwen3.5 的训练配置。新的拟合还预测，随着模型规模增加，最优学习率的下降速度更慢。批量大小与学习率的预测分别在不同训练条件下验证</span></strong></p><ul list="u8ac07f4a"><li fid="u644a5424" data-lake-id="u75a5ef8b" id="u75a5ef8b"><strong><span data-lake-id="ua5db19b4" id="ua5db19b4">小模型、长训练预算。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u9d4c396b" id="u9d4c396b">在训练 4T 词元的 10.8B-A0.89B 模型上，将每步批量从 12.6M 词元调整至预测值 25.2M，并使用对应学习率，最终损失降低约 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%227.2%5C%5Ctimes10%5E%7B-3%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F482268ee87db7cb147c2d0321186c3fa.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aBfoh%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub5263a78" id="ub5263a78">；进一步增至 37.7M，损失仅小幅变差。</span></li><li fid="u644a5424" data-lake-id="u896b9e22" id="u896b9e22"><strong><span data-lake-id="u25ed12f2" id="u25ed12f2">大模型、有限训练预算。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue4260d5a" id="ue4260d5a">在训练 419B 词元的 48 层 156B-A7B 模型上，新配置相较旧配置使最终损失降低约</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%227.8%5C%5Ctimes10%5E%7B-3%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F551bc4510e83d6b3ebf520588610976a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rRuI7%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua9404c8e" id="ua9404c8e">，并改善下游表现。预测值附近的多组配置表现接近，说明其位于较平坦的近最优区域</span></li><li fid="u644a5424" data-lake-id="u80e38b82" id="u80e38b82"><strong><span data-lake-id="ufbbfd1db" id="ufbbfd1db">在本文配置下，批量大小预热没有带来收益。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u50f2c14e" id="u50f2c14e"> 将批量逐步增加至目标值，并未优于从训练开始就采用目标批量；在相同词元预算下，反而增加18.8% 的优化器更新步数，也未改善稳定性。因此，正式训练不采用批量大小预热</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u043887f6" id="u043887f6" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1793526925289-2fd9b8ff-251a-4c07-bb89-94789aab04e0.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ub6c53b4e-d247-4f81-aa89-459cb2fc800%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u55d9a5d2-333b-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A725.2000732421875%2C%22height%22%3A336%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A223594%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1314%2C%22originHeight%22%3A608%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22B%3A6.3M-25.2M%2CN%3D3.60X10%22%2C%22x%22%3A907%2C%22y%22%3A421%2C%22width%22%3A266%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BRAPEDBATCHSIZE.%22%2C%22x%22%3A855%2C%22y%22%3A573%2C%22width%22%3A268%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ACONSTANTBATCHSIZE.%22%2C%22x%22%3A168%2C%22y%22%3A573%2C%22width%22%3A283%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CONSUMEDTOKENSB%22%2C%22x%22%3A934%2C%22y%22%3A520%2C%22width%22%3A208%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ONSUMEDTOKENSB)%22%2C%22x%22%3A267%2C%22y%22%3A519%2C%22width%22%3A205%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22B%3A6.3M-25.2MN%3D5.39XI10%22%2C%22x%22%3A898%2C%22y%22%3A390%2C%22width%22%3A269%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22-B%3D12.6M%2C7%3D3.49X10%22%2C%22x%22%3A133%2C%22y%22%3A431%2C%22width%22%3A250%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22B-37.7M%2CN-6.92X10%22%2C%22x%22%3A150%2C%22y%22%3A400%2C%22width%22%3A234%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A702%2C%22y%22%3A173%2C%22width%22%3A19%2C%22height%22%3A135%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%80B%3D25.2M%2CN%3D5.39X10-%22%2C%22x%22%3A884%2C%22y%22%3A359%2C%22width%22%3A244%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22B-25.2M%2CM-5.39X10%22%2C%22x%22%3A160%2C%22y%22%3A370%2C%22width%22%3A216%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A11%2C%22y%22%3A170%2C%22width%22%3A22%2C%22height%22%3A146%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%9B%BE%22%2C%22x%22%3A778%2C%22y%22%3A422%2C%22width%22%3A82%2C%22height%22%3A34%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221.85%22%2C%22x%22%3A48%2C%22y%22%3A116%2C%22width%22%3A42%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222000%22%2C%22x%22%3A995%2C%22y%22%3A485%2C%22width%22%3A68%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221.5705%22%2C%22x%22%3A1012%2C%22y%22%3A248%2C%22width%22%3A53%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%223000%22%2C%22x%22%3A454%2C%22y%22%3A485%2C%22width%22%3A60%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221.65%22%2C%22x%22%3A50%2C%22y%22%3A346%2C%22width%22%3A44%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222000%22%2C%22x%22%3A318%2C%22y%22%3A485%2C%22width%22%3A74%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%228%22%2C%22x%22%3A55%2C%22y%22%3A236%2C%22width%22%3A32%2C%22height%22%3A74%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%223000%22%2C%22x%22%3A1118%2C%22y%22%3A484%2C%22width%22%3A64%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%224000%22%2C%22x%22%3A1260%2C%22y%22%3A483%2C%22width%22%3A48%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%224000%22%2C%22x%22%3A587%2C%22y%22%3A489%2C%22width%22%3A47%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221000%22%2C%22x%22%3A209%2C%22y%22%3A484%2C%22width%22%3A49%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220%22%2C%22x%22%3A53%2C%22y%22%3A173%2C%22width%22%3A39%2C%22height%22%3A63%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221.55%22%2C%22x%22%3A42%2C%22y%22%3A456%2C%22width%22%3A55%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221.60%22%2C%22x%22%3A50%2C%22y%22%3A402%2C%22width%22%3A40%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221000%22%2C%22x%22%3A883%2C%22y%22%3A484%2C%22width%22%3A48%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%224020%22%2C%22x%22%3A1236%2C%22y%22%3A308%2C%22width%22%3A30%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22.5710%22%2C%22x%22%3A297%2C%22y%22%3A110%2C%22width%22%3A41%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2216%22%2C%22x%22%3A732%2C%22y%22%3A411%2C%22width%22%3A44%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22.95%22%2C%22x%22%3A53%2C%22y%22%3A8%2C%22width%22%3A34%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%223990%22%2C%22x%22%3A1109%2C%22y%22%3A305%2C%22width%22%3A32%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221.90%22%2C%22x%22%3A47%2C%22y%22%3A63%2C%22width%22%3A45%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22.5720%22%2C%22x%22%3A300%2C%22y%22%3A27%2C%22width%22%3A53%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22.5715%22%2C%22x%22%3A297%2C%22y%22%3A69%2C%22width%22%3A45%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221.570%22%2C%22x%22%3A297%2C%22y%22%3A150%2C%22width%22%3A37%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221.5715-%22%2C%22x%22%3A1010%2C%22y%22%3A139%2C%22width%22%3A59%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23faf8f7%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ub2489972%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u95ac5d57" id="u95ac5d57"><strong><span data-lake-id="uc1b3f05e" id="uc1b3f05e" style="color: #DF2A3F">压力测试检验高学习率下的稳定裕度。论文在 28 层 MoE 上，将学习率固定为最优值的 2 倍或 4 倍，不使用常规衰减，并在相同批量大小和梯度裁剪阈值下比较不同配置。评价指标包括损失尖峰、裁剪前梯度范数及激活极值</span></strong></p><ul list="ufd7060cb"><li fid="uca092df7" data-lake-id="u48292605" id="u48292605"><span data-lake-id="ue17438fc" id="ue17438fc">在 4 倍最优学习率下，AdamW 基线每万步出现 183 次损失尖峰；两个 Muon 配置均未跨越梯度裁剪阈值，其中 Muon 与 GR 的组合未出现损失尖峰。结果表明，新架构与优化器组合在相同压力条件下具有更大的稳定裕度</span></li><li fid="uca092df7" data-lake-id="ub4c0923f" id="ub4c0923f"><strong><span data-lake-id="u832623cb" id="u832623cb">门控的稳定化作用得到单变量实验支持。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u0ef886b1" id="u0ef886b1"> 在保持 AdamW、模型结构及其他条件一致的情况下，仅启用 GatedNorm，就使 3 倍最优学习率下的损失尖峰从每万步 32.0 次降至 3.2 次，梯度范数越过阈值的次数从 256 次降至 20 次。作者据此认为，乘性门控提供显式的重缩放机制，有助于抑制高学习率下的激活离群值与训练波动</span></li><li fid="uca092df7" data-lake-id="u14caf374" id="u14caf374"><strong><span data-lake-id="u0f70a191" id="u0f70a191">正式训练验证上述收益。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u4d275db6" id="u4d275db6"> 在使用相同数据顺序、学习率调度与优化器的前三组 276B 词元训练对比中，相较于 Qwen3.5 架构与 Muon 的组合，加入 GR 使损失降低 0.026，完整 Flash-Next 方案进一步降低 0.032，累计改善 0.058。门控配置同时降低梯度范数波动和残差激活极值，使模型在不依赖 qk-clip、SwiGLU-clip 等显式激活控制方法的情况下保持稳定训练</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uec60a209" id="uec60a209" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1793526847768-4f4f5f57-734f-4e3d-9ba9-4430ce97bfcc.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u8f7e7b0c-24a2-45b5-9aca-75be0986b58%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u55d9a5d2-333b-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A692.2000732421875%2C%22height%22%3A319%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A299232%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1319%2C%22originHeight%22%3A607%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22APRE-CLIPGRADIENTNORM.%22%2C%22x%22%3A156%2C%22y%22%3A572%2C%22width%22%3A316%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TRAININGSTEP(THOUSANDS)%22%2C%22x%22%3A910%2C%22y%22%3A539%2C%22width%22%3A248%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BMAXIMUMMLPOUTPUT.%22%2C%22x%22%3A826%2C%22y%22%3A572%2C%22width%22%3A328%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TRAININGSTEPTHOUSANDS%22%2C%22x%22%3A236%2C%22y%22%3A539%2C%22width%22%3A239%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A686%2C%22y%22%3A122%2C%22width%22%3A21%2C%22height%22%3A275%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ADAMW%2CQWEN3.5STRUCTURE%22%2C%22x%22%3A346%2C%22y%22%3A51%2C%22width%22%3A255%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A14%2C%22y%22%3A134%2C%22width%22%3A23%2C%22height%22%3A258%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ADAMW%2CQWEN3.5STRUCTURE%22%2C%22x%22%3A1032%2C%22y%22%3A51%2C%22width%22%3A243%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MUON%2BGATEDRESIDUAL%22%2C%22x%22%3A1036%2C%22y%22%3A100%2C%22width%22%3A219%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MUON%2BGATEDRESIDUAL%22%2C%22x%22%3A349%2C%22y%22%3A101%2C%22width%22%3A228%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MUONQWEN3.5STRUCTURE%22%2C%22x%22%3A348%2C%22y%22%3A76%2C%22width%22%3A244%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MUON%2CQWEN3.5STRUCTURE%22%2C%22x%22%3A1036%2C%22y%22%3A75%2C%22width%22%3A228%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222000%22%2C%22x%22%3A717%2C%22y%22%3A100%2C%22width%22%3A48%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221500%22%2C%22x%22%3A710%2C%22y%22%3A196%2C%22width%22%3A54%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220.5%22%2C%22x%22%3A55%2C%22y%22%3A67%2C%22width%22%3A35%2C%22height%22%3A31%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220.05%22%2C%22x%22%3A44%2C%22y%22%3A395%2C%22width%22%3A45%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221000%22%2C%22x%22%3A718%2C%22y%22%3A286%2C%22width%22%3A43%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22100%22%2C%22x%22%3A1271%2C%22y%22%3A504%2C%22width%22%3A34%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22100%22%2C%22x%22%3A586%2C%22y%22%3A505%2C%22width%22%3A45%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220.03%22%2C%22x%22%3A49%2C%22y%22%3A476%2C%22width%22%3A41%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2260%22%2C%22x%22%3A382%2C%22y%22%3A506%2C%22width%22%3A50%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2280%22%2C%22x%22%3A491%2C%22y%22%3A505%2C%22width%22%3A36%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2240%22%2C%22x%22%3A294%2C%22y%22%3A506%2C%22width%22%3A35%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23faf1ed%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u43f5b7b2%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p>